{
  "id": "756",
  "title": "Happy Father’s Day",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2019-06-14",
  "synopsis": "Old Li is telling Miss Zhang about the present he got for Father’s Day from his daughter.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1076/64fd6a416a87447c007fc86faa6b12376115915f.mp3?1560417428",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "父亲节快乐\n\n张姐：新手表？真漂亮！\n老李：谢谢！今天是父亲节，这是我女儿送给我的父亲节礼物。\n张姐：还是生女儿好啊！女儿懂事！\n老李：是啊！虽然她在国外工作，但每年父亲节或是我的生日，她总会送礼物给我。\n张姐：你真是有福气啊！女儿既能干又孝顺！祝你父亲节快乐！\n老李：谢谢！",
    "traditional": "父親節快樂\n\n張姐：新手錶？真漂亮！\n老李：謝謝！今天是父親節，這是我女兒送給我的父親節禮物。\n張姐：還是生女兒好啊！女兒懂事！\n老李：是啊！雖然她在國外工作，但每年父親節或是我的生日，她總會送禮物給我。\n張姐：你真是有福氣啊！女兒既能幹又孝順！祝你父親節快樂！\n老李：謝謝！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Happy Father’s Day"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "张姐：新手表？真漂亮！",
      "traditional": "張姐：新手錶？真漂亮！",
      "pinyin": "zhāng jiě xīn shǒu biǎo zhēn piào liang",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Miss Zhang: A new wristwatch? It’s really good-looking!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "老李：谢谢！今天是父亲节，这是我女儿送给我的父亲节礼物。",
      "traditional": "老李：謝謝！今天是父親節，這是我女兒送給我的父親節禮物。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo lǐ xiè xie jīn tiān shì fù qīn jié zhè shì wǒ nǚ ér sòng gěi wǒ de fù qīn jié lǐ wù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Old Li: Thank you! It’s Father’s Day today, this is the Father’s Day present that my daughter gave to me."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "张姐：还是生女儿好啊！女儿懂事！",
      "traditional": "張姐：還是生女兒好啊！女兒懂事！",
      "pinyin": "zhāng jiě hái shi shēng nǚ ér hǎo a nǚ ér dǒng shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Miss Zhang: Having a daughter is the best after all. Daughters are considerate!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "老李：是啊！虽然她在国外工作，但每年父亲节或是我的生日，她总会送礼物给我。",
      "traditional": "老李：是啊！雖然她在國外工作，但每年父親節或是我的生日，她總會送禮物給我。",
      "pinyin": "lǎo lǐ shì a suī rán tā zài guó wài gōng zuò dàn měi nián fù qīn jié huò shì wǒ de shēng rì tā zǒng huì sòng lǐ wù gěi wǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Old Li: Yes! Although she works abroad, every year for Father’s Day or my birthday, she always sends a present to me."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "张姐：你真是有福气啊！女儿既能干又孝顺！",
      "traditional": "張姐：你真是有福氣啊！女兒既能幹又孝順！",
      "pinyin": "zhāng jiě nǐ zhēn shì yǒu fú qi a nǚ ér jì néng gàn yòu xiào shùn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "祝你父亲节快乐！",
      "traditional": "祝你父親節快樂！",
      "pinyin": "zhù nǐ fù qīn jié kuài lè",
      "english": "Miss Zhang: You are really lucky! Your daughter is both competent and filial!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I wish you a happy Father’s Day!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "老李：谢谢！",
      "traditional": "老李：謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "lǎo lǐ xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Old Li: Thank you!"
    }
  ],
